    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a4e64117c44e6c06aa329e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎么评价速子同学吗……？\n……『诡骗师』。\n这个词就足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf45686187ac003c01946d64e2ccae04b6f3ebcd71dbbe7fbe2f2409e92e78b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e3d1426429acdf309f0a3c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我泡咖啡的时候……\n小雪同学就会烤曲奇出来一起吃……\n真是位如摇篮一般温柔的人呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "28afd9255ebbc58a2f984c72f26ea01dd18689d1221969e7908ba2d4b1728dde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67977c4ccb434e94c67a50e4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "错觉也是知觉的一种……\n这样想的话，不管看见什么\n都不会觉得奇怪了吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e3d30fdd8a052a511ec3fe86aa37031ca9a663302f1d555506209d1362910f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f5b00db679a923c7f884e9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "海拔越高，越能培育出好咖啡豆……\n以山的名字命名咖啡豆，\n也是这个原因……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d4d195111dc43877cd66419848bebe5a62dcce9661278831aa9eecac21908f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07f4de48bf7e0aa6922c10fc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "人鱼终会化作泡沫回归大海……\n赛马娘也会变作飞尘，\n归于大地吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1dc7fa8cbcd81010c6c334875fe84a4e1460641bd220703827c8c17937306f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b5ac1577c3164a2a16ac407",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "翩翩飘舞……投影摇曳……\n我倒是不讨厌翩翩起舞的衣物之影呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "59dec2a8591efe848610634db889f5567882b1bb7a3e52eea44adedf4fd304a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ce31ecaaa3d4e3fbf0d2d4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "舞台上灯光太过明亮、太过刺眼……\n要是能再暗一些就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c4dd2202a82093813e257db9817b82f4059495993862965954ad002864140c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa8460c364445aa34d7fe05",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这身衣服就像咖啡一般漆黑而深邃……\n穿着它就能静下心来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98fe3d59b446d29e484b95ba5942ada0e9c4cd734b14d269887cd17f7d415ec1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a34dc3cbff458a32b4f002",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论多少种颜色混合起来，都只会变成黑色……\n黑色……是能够吞噬一切、接受一切的颜色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94aa4c27da0bb1dc719d3859725f3084d3e1fdd59a3b7e90c726d6ba21b18035",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:704683e8e8a1614ea585c5d5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早起磨咖啡豆的时间……\n是独属于我的、宝贵的时间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "96b766e18f58d5fe5aff49b49977fe292cc22e6470f5feeb6f9d43fd9d30c414",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cace8ea6435440c4f3175906",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "食堂的咖啡丝毫不逊色于外面咖啡店的咖啡……\n不过因为食堂人太多，很难抢到呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0b6029cf2c39caf841159302cb20cafeda4507c55b9e5f3c7932a51dda90e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15ae4105c177a435eaa5c271",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…迷い込んだのですか？\r\n出口は…さて、\r\nどちらでしょう…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8b7cebbeea1e030b6a56335234dc525ffa8b7ac5ab274af5658567b42fb0bd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "910100"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/910100"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b09122c9c21edf5fc7e8f2e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是我找到了神灯的话，\n我会许下这样的心愿……\n『就让我永远身处夜幕之中』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "45d0b121600c132c0d277898ca77502735280152f7a5da5880ce94c11ec8bb23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017b7ada25a954bcbd7420df",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在樱花树下――\n哦呀？您想到了什么呢？\n……请告诉我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f0eb4e7d781ed31eff72603b6109c2e6d8dc7a9ac3a80ead53bfa60a3917161",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0460bc9fef05e353a151afab",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "雨落个不停……蜗牛也爬出来了呢……\n我也……喜欢像它们这样待在壳里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5272df14f82a4b561872e64d3208e7cd5d58729fff4d950f1c0464dadb473f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de6610f1760a6a55166a57c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小小的红色手掌浮现在地面上，\n不断变多、不断变多……\n……对。我说的是红叶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fec111ff8f9f1570e56005e34926dcf6f083624592e5805a3535b5a9f010b0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:907262aa8006f6dff6914f93",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着水晶球的话，\n就会觉得心情畅快……\n只要不把玻璃打破的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f5c06846e5b6a608ec8bbff7019c989cc27a799abc692513a7d3f733db00074",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3577c225785c57299710e9b3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ポッケさんとタキオンさん、最後の\r\n苺大福を取り合ってしまって…。\r\n均等に分け合えばいいのに…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b6e634f6ed631fcecc1f6608e8a123b8e8239795a06dc4535914ca7653329b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74077f557c119d01123a9dbf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『あなたならガーリー系！』と、\r\nフライトさんに指南を受けまして…\r\nお洒落は奥が深い、のですね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea235988f4a678d41aa1c5de0241ee4b55e6b269203c708f9b6a277417547cb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a555236daa543d1e61d54426",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "バクシンオーさんが、髪が伸びる\r\n人形を…成長期なのですね、と…。\r\nふふ…太陽のような方です…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a771bc9e1e8cf707235cc18c2e2282a9260ad12ac866810b9350145d435c65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0598d362a76dcc911efb2dc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『全力で登山をしようよ！』…と、\r\nチケットさんに誘われて…。限界を\r\n越えた景色に、辿り着けるかも…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b04ff116e0d89e20e02f109f1b683703ebafae30141170cc32553381d896058",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d96d00a7ba2013cbd1f84c2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "メルヘンなお菓子を作ると、弟や\r\n妹たちが喜んでくれて…。見た目を\r\n凝ったレシピは、今でも覚えてます",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd7c2fd1a381c169cdd573b14eddcb4fe893e9c3ad9f03ae9f60fb9fd09fbae3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8db3c26a04d977dc2a88d8d6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今朝、夢で見た純白の月光花…。\r\nアナタに見せたいくらい、綺麗で…\r\n和菓子で再現できないでしょうか…",
      "source_fingerprint": "744856f226b76faa46a73915614a298fa07e245291f13234df9c5a62e010199b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0244cdc4cdd990a8a2d4d5da",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ダンスレッスンは…タップさんと、\r\nバロックダンスを。欧州の踊りは…\r\n少しだけ、興味があります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ab885b1a94e5ee8a0b8fdc2290c85e8bcd8a9e5762660be82b32e66913e7f92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a2275e36069fc42ff16300",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "お風呂の後は、髪を乾かすのが\r\n大変で…。チヨノオーさんが、\r\n手伝ってくれることも…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "496272e6778d6032d9c69662bd9850ae9759c4283a5b6a7219b92c7712b48394",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "91023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1025/91023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7afbf122bf9b323ae8733fde",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "満開の桜並木で走り込み…清々しい\r\n気持ち、でした。誘ってくれた\r\nローレルさんには、感謝です…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bfde18d38983a38d73366a549f63d791c18b021c8a78aeb62bd3ca17b2254d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
